# Data attributions

## Airport reference data

`data/airports.json` is derived from **OurAirports**:

- Source: https://davidmegginson.github.io/ourairports-data/airports.csv
- Project: https://ourairports.com/data/
- License: public domain (as stated by the OurAirports data page)

Only IATA code, airport name, municipality, and ISO country are retained.

## Airline reference data

`data/airlines.json` is derived from **OpenFlights**:

- Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jpatokal/openflights/master/data/airlines.dat
- Project: https://openflights.org/data.html
- License: Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0 —
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Only active ICAO designator and airline name are retained. The derived airline
lookup table is made available under the same ODbL terms.

## Flight data

Flight data is fetched at runtime from the Hong Kong International Airport public
flight-information service. It is not bundled with this project.

## Runway in use

Runway in use, the ATIS letter and issue time, and the airport wind are fetched
at runtime from the Civil Aviation Department's public ATIS page:

- Page: https://atis.cad.gov.hk/ATIS/ATISweb/atis.php
- Landing page: https://www.hkatc.gov.hk/
- Provider: Civil Aviation Department, HKSAR Government

The runway-selection policy referenced in the output is published in the Hong
Kong Aeronautical Information Publication, VHHH AD 2.22:
https://www.ais.gov.hk/eaip/

Wind components are computed locally from the reported wind and the runway
designator. No ATIS text or wind observation is stored.

## Airport access data

Live Airport Express train times and the AEL delay flag are fetched at runtime
from the **MTR Next Train** API published through data.gov.hk:

- Endpoint: https://rt.data.gov.hk/v1/transport/mtr/getSchedule.php
- Dataset: https://data.gov.hk/en-data/dataset/mtr-data2-nexttrain-data
- Provider: MTR Corporation Limited

Live airport-bus ETAs are fetched at runtime from the operators' public APIs:

- Citybus: https://rt.data.gov.hk/v2/transport/citybus/eta/CTB/{stop}/{route}
- Long Win / KMB: https://data.etabus.gov.hk/v1/transport/kmb/eta/{stop}/{route}/1
- New Lantao Bus: https://rt.data.gov.hk/v2/transport/nlb/stop.php?action=estimatedArrivals

Providers: Citybus Limited, Long Win Bus Company Limited, The Kowloon Motor Bus
Company Limited, and New Lantao Bus Company (1973) Limited.

The following reference facts are bundled as dated snapshots in
`data/access_ael_fares.json`, `data/access_checkin.json` and
`data/access_bus.json`, generated by `scripts/refresh_access_data.py` and
checked on **2026-11-22**. They are factual timetable/fare/service information,
not a copy of a database, and remain subject to the providers' terms:

- Airport Express journey times, first/last trains and frequency:
  https://www.mtr.com.hk/en/customer/services/timetable_index.html and
  https://www.mtr.com.hk/en/customer/services/train_service_index.html
- Airport Express Octopus, single and 30-day round-trip fares:
  https://opendata.mtr.com.hk/data/airport_express_fares.csv and
  https://www.mtr.com.hk/en/customer/tickets/tf_index.html
- In-town check-in participating airlines, station hours and conditions:
  https://www.mtr.com.hk/en/customer/services/complom_checkin.html
- Airport A-route bus destinations, fares, operators, live-ETA stop IDs and
  city/airport departure windows:
  https://www.hongkongairport.com/en/transport/to-from-airport/public-buses.page

MTR, Citybus, LWB, KMB, NLB, HKIA and the Civil Aviation Department are not
affiliated with this project and do not endorse it. Verify hours, fares,
runways and availability with the provider before travel.
